    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nApt. 5 Richmond Hall is a well presented one-bedroom ground floor apartment situated within this highly regarded gated development of just 90 apartments. Offering bright, well-proportioned accommodation it an ideal choice for first-time buyers, downsizers, or investors seeking a quality property in a prime city-fringe location.\n\nThe accommodation is entered from a lobby area into the welcoming entrance hall with large walk in storage/ utility space, open plan kitchen/ living/ dining room with access to a balcony. The spacious double bedroom is complete with a fitted wardrobe, and the fully tiled bathroom completes the layout of this delightful apartment. \nThe property also benefits from one underground parking space.\n\nThe location is excellent, just a short stroll from all amenities (both social and essential) and within minutes of the city centre with O'Connell Street approx. 2kms away. There are many local amenities such as Croke Park, Fairview Park and Clontarf Seafront and Na Fianna GAA club. It is within easy reach of Mater Hospital, Temple Street Hospital, Dublin City University, St. Patrick's Teacher Training College, Trinity College, IFSC. The area is well served by public transport with Dublin Bus, Drumcondra Station, Clontarf Station and Connolly Station. For those travelling further afield the property is very convenient to Dublin Airport, the M50 and the M1.\n\nIf you would like a viewing of this property, please email us at Drumcondra@sherryfitz.ie or call the office directly on 018373737 to arrange an appointment. If you wish to place an offer, please visit www.sherryfitz.ie where you can register to make an offer on this property"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nLiving Room - 4.214m x 3.965m\nBright open plan kitchen and livingroom. There is a wooden floor and access out to a balcony\n\nKitchen - 1.337m x 2.230m\nBuilt in wall and floor units, with an oven, hob & extractor fan. Tiled floor and splashback\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.191m x 3.084m\nGenerous double room with built in wardrobe\n\nBathroom - 2.636m x 1.78m\nComprises of a wc, whb and bath with shower attachement. The walls and floor are tiled.\n\nUtility Room - 1.782m x 1.407\nlarege space with ample room for storage\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Spacious one bedroom ground floor apartment</li><li>blacony off the livingroom</li><li>Set behind secure electronic gates </li><li>Ready for immediate occupancy</li><li>Open-plan living/dining/kitchen area</li><li>One underground parking space</li><li>Excellent location close to abundance of amenities</li><li>Short drive to M1, M50 and Dublin Airport</ul>"
      },
